cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "bosonic-dla-finiteness: Dimensional Classification of Bosonic Hamiltonian Lie Algebras"
abstract: >-
  bosonic-dla-finiteness is a Python library for classifying dynamical Lie algebras generated by
  polynomial bosonic Hamiltonians. It certifies finite- or infinite-dimensionality where possible
  and otherwise identifies cases requiring further analysis.
type: software
version: 1.0.1
date-released: "2026-08-31"
